	"Version": 1,
	"VersionName": "0.1",
	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Projectile",
	"Description": "Projectiles for the GSTN combat, deterministic first: a projectile is spawned once with its parameters (origin, direction, speed, gravity, lifetime, owner) and every machine computes its position from them with the ballistic mode (closed form, no per-tick replication). The host sweeps it against hurtboxes at the fixed tick and posts a normal hit into the victim's inbox, so the melee hit pipeline applies unchanged. GSTNProjectileCore is pure (no GAS, no Network Prediction); GSTNProjectileNP is the world side (needs the GAS-NPP fork).",
